  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to NGO FEMINA HIP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective for the Danish support is to promote access to knowledge about sexual and reproductive health and rights (SRHR), economic empowerment and citizen engagement to Tanzanian youth. Through clubs, magazines and media engagement Femina Hip contributes to changing harmful behaviour, social norms and attitudes in regards to SRHR and gender equality. It furthermore supports entrepreneurial mind-sets and empowerment, giving Tanzanian youth a stronger voice.</narrative>
  </description>
